// Item Definitions for ArenaSim Equipment System
//
// Each item has a unique ItemId key and provides stat bonuses.
// Weapons (is_weapon: true) replace attack_damage/weapon_speed on the primary weapon slot.
// `weapon_speed` is seconds per swing — the Classic tooltip's "Speed", copied
// exactly from the real Classic item named beside it (same weapon type and
// hand, same role, nearest item level; the same-named item when one exists
// within 5 item levels). Damage per swing is the item's weapon DPS times that
// speed, and a two-hander's DPS carries Classic's two-hander premium over the
// one-hander it displaces — see docs/design/balance/2026-09-28-as167-weapon-speed.md.
// Non-weapon items add their stats to the combatant's base stats.
//
// Changes here take effect on restart without recompiling.

