        // ====================================================================
        // RELICS — the Ranged socket for classes that train no ranged weapon
        //
        // A Libram (Paladin) or a Totem (Shaman) is a stat stick, not a weapon:
        // no damage, no swing, no range. `weapon_type: Relic` is what carries
        // that through the proficiency gate, and `allowed_classes` keeps a
        // Libram off a Shaman and a Totem off a Paladin.
        //
        // Budget: ilvl 58 accessory = 58 * 0.75 * 0.5625 = 24.5 points. These
        // deliberately spend under half of it, so a relic contributes roughly
        // what the wands and bows in this socket contribute in BUDGETED stats
        // (6-8 points) — closing the gap without handing two healers a
        // full-budget accessory no other class's ranged item provides.
        // ====================================================================

